# Pairs with LivePublisherPinned. A leaf read that faults reports a husk instead
# of failing closed, so a live leaf's only pin is retired.
MODULE: LivePublisherPinnedFailedReadReadsAsHusk
TARGET: LivePublisherPinned
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a faulted leaf read is reported as a husk
PERTURBS: ReadFail
BOUNDS: MaxFaults = 1

--- FIND
    /\ verdict' = [verdict EXCEPT ![p] = "unreadable"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a faulted read is not fail-closed.
    /\ verdict' = [verdict EXCEPT ![p] = "husk"]
--- END
